                            	   708: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039FE4 00039FF0        	   709:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039FE8 0003A0DA        	   710:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
