                            	  3813: L_EndInitFlyingGhini:
02:0003B594 6100FEAA        	  3814:     jsr     DrawGhiniAndCheckCollisions
                            	  3815:     ; If we're finally leaving the object flagged "initialized",
                            	  3816:     ; then reset metastate and initialize this as a flyer.
