                            	  5635:     ; I don't know why the object timer of the tail segment that will
                            	  5636:     ; be made dead is set to $11. By setting its object type to $5D
                            	  5637:     ; below, its metastate will become $10 -- dying/dead. From
                            	  5638:     ; there, the object timer is set to 6.
                            	  5639:     ;
02:0003C33E 7011            	  5640:     moveq   #17,D0
02:0003C340 19803029        	  5641:     move.b  D0,($29,A4,D3.W)
                            	  5642:     ; Copy the invincibility timer, X, and Y from the original dead
                            	  5643:     ; segment to the tail segment.
