                            	  9778: _L_z04_UpdateGohma_AnimateClosedEye:
                            	  9779:     ; Here the eye is closed. So animate it this way.
                            	  9780:     ; Increment the animation counter, and if <> 8, then
                            	  9781:     ; go shoot, draw, and check collisions.
