                            	  5375: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5376:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5377:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5378:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5379:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5380:     ;
                            	  5381:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5382:     ;
